	(text "D+/D- go straight to PA12/PA11 (90 ohm diff pair, short). Shield tied to GND.\nVBUS -> power sheet. ROM DFU needs the 8 MHz HSE (auto-detected)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 294.64 205.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "78c46ef2-671c-42ad-a92c-4199311ecada"))
	(text "PIN ASSIGNMENT (agree with firmware .ioc before layout)\nSPI1  PA5 SCK / PA6 MISO / PA7 MOSI, PA4 FLASH_CS -> W25Q128 flash (only SPI device)\nI2C1  PB6 SCL / PB7 SDA -> shared sensor bus (IMU + barometer), 4.7k pull-ups\n      PC5 IMU_INT1, PC6 IMU_INT2, PC7 BARO_INT\nUSB FS PA11 D- / PA12 D+ -> USB-C (ROM DFU bootloader: BOOT0 high at reset)\nUSART2 PA2 TX / PA3 RX (debug)   PA9 unused, PA10 10k pull-up (bootloader USART1)\nSWD   PA13 SWDIO / PA14 SWCLK / PB3 SWO, NRST -> ST-LINK header\nHSE 8 MHz on PH0/PH1 (needed for USB + DFU); LSE unused; PC0 status LED\nPower: VDD x4, VDDA, VBAT on +3V3; decoupling per DS8626 power supply scheme.\nUnused GPIO marked no-connect; remove the X to use a pin." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 208.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid "dde49ee6-26b8-457e-86bc-ac64ce713561"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
